ngspice

jolty's diode, Gummel-Poon bipolar transistor, VBIC 1.2 transistor, JFET, MOSFETs of levels 1
and 3, VDMOS, and the junctions they share, in crates/jolty-models/src/kernel/, follow ngspice
47's implementations of them: their equations, constants, temperature scaling and limiting.
The Verilog-A diode in crates/jolty-veriloga/models/diode.va, and the limited diode in
crates/jolty-veriloga/tests/fixtures/limited_diode.va, follow the same diode and junction,
and so do the kernels compiled from them, in crates/jolty-veriloga/src/kernels/diode.rs and
crates/jolty-veriloga/tests/fixtures/limited_diode.rs.

